    ],
    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "mr lee",
        "speaker": "Mr. Lee",
        "sourceStart": 9,
        "sourceEnd": 102,
        "text": "Today we're discussing homework before practising paragraph writing. Anna, what do you think?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "a0650ecf93c05bb650361be25366d68b0b213a7f9d799df3ec0a4d14eee46ba7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "anna",
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "sourceStart": 109,
        "sourceEnd": 264,
        "text": "I think homework is very important because it helps us practice what we learn in class. Although we have many subjects, homework makes us review every day.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "3ef667d41f28d8aa63f8ea3474ed6c8fdea6bffd661b88aa2d30fc4c3539fe4b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mr lee",
        "speaker": "Mr. Lee",
        "sourceStart": 274,
        "sourceEnd": 372,
        "text": "Ben, do you agree? Some students say their after-school activities leave little time for homework.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "e4cc1e8f96c1676c58784e7b4afb2ab0eecf8aef032c0d6a2633b19b27838dfb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 378,
        "sourceEnd": 542,
        "text": "I agree that it's useful, but we need balance. Last week I had three hours of homework each night because of the math test. I had to cancel football practice twice.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "3fe2ec2bd8c0b258c9cc7202ec17c15bdbfe81b461f62ed1fd02c2cf65c2abbc",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "anna",
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "sourceStart": 549,
        "sourceEnd": 691,
        "text": "Although sometimes it's boring, it's still important. Because of homework, I remember new words better. We might forget them without practice.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "628e5c086aa90a02a0ca932d47fd91f23c4c67c580b34d50cc8cdcbc42b7f734",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 697,
        "sourceEnd": 902,
        "text": "I understand that. While homework is useful, too much homework can make us tired. Because of the pressure, some students feel stressed. I believe we should have less homework so we can have more free time.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "58ce7808a9bae4ee347077c1f4780861b2d2e571407fa061de86371075a91e17",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mr lee",
        "speaker": "Mr. Lee",
        "sourceStart": 912,
        "sourceEnd": 1102,
        "text": "Good. You partly agree, but you emphasise different things. Anna values practice and memory; Ben wants a better balance. Neither position can be supported simply by repeating it more loudly.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "7902dec6a9d6977f2924903bd9d0237670d6b97a06a2267cdba60d16101f9b24",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "anna",
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "sourceStart": 1109,
        "sourceEnd": 1158,
        "text": "So how do we organise these ideas in a paragraph?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "6ad2f04bd065638d57587941ec1a5fbdfb6233316d813de71df3f67893b71fd5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mr lee",
        "speaker": "Mr. Lee",
        "sourceStart": 1168,
        "sourceEnd": 1412,
        "text": "A topic sentence tells the main idea, and supporting sentences give details. Anna could support her opinion with the example about new words. Ben could describe the week before his math test. An example should connect clearly to the main point.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "fb1c06160569924e15cd86a3d8ea5d01d844a98e59a84dc62001da98f32596da",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1418,
        "sourceEnd": 1477,
        "text": "And the connecting words help readers follow our reasoning?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "ee706016d1f3fc4da0fff98c4533b3869d266f33939336b369ac6b3d2cb36cc4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mr lee",
        "speaker": "Mr. Lee",
        "sourceStart": 1487,
        "sourceEnd": 1714,
        "text": "Exactly. In these examples, 'although' and 'while' show contrast, and 'because' and 'because of' show reason. Use 'because' before a clause, but 'because of' before a noun phrase. They are not interchangeable in every sentence.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "101724cd362cc6ae5d437270e16a4319588df5d7eb1d41946d26d992860204a2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "anna",
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "sourceStart": 1721,
        "sourceEnd": 1754,
        "text": "Can we practise with a new topic?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "31b7f6040e0fb21680c15a8210c325b53f63813987989c034ae5a1050026ca5c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mr lee",
        "speaker": "Mr. Lee",
        "sourceStart": 1764,
        "sourceEnd": 1962,
        "text": "Yes. Your topic is 'Should students have more free time?' Write a topic sentence and two supporting sentences. Remember to use 'although', 'while', 'because', or 'because of'. We'll share next time.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "86c05474093146e504976f1831da44d7933249e062f6fb53bdfbd1e54c5bc24d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1968,
        "sourceEnd": 2037,
        "text": "I'll try to give a specific example instead of another general claim.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "08b94407f98ae14b080d9a3060cc54b6ab822da31c84fb2d446a31a836e6a1e1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
